{"overview":{"Symbol":"NRSNW","Name":"NeuroSense Therapeutics Ltd.","Description":"NeuroSense Therapeutics Ltd., a clinical-stage biotechnology company, focuses on discovering and developing treatments for patients suffering from neurodegenerative diseases in the United States and internationally. The company's lead product is PrimeC, an extended-release oral formulation of a fixed-dose combination of ciprofloxacin and celecoxib, currently under Phase 2b/3 clinical trials for the treatment of amyotrophic lateral sclerosis, and completed Phase 2 clinical trials for the treatment of Alzheimer's, as well as under preclinical studies for the treatment of Parkinson's disease. Its preclinical pipeline includes StabiliC for the treatment of Parkinson's disease; and CogniC for the treatment of Alzheimer's disease. NeuroSense Therapeutics Ltd. was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Herzliya, Israel.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqCM","Currency":"USD","Country":"Israel","Sector":"","Industry":"","Address":"Building B, Herzliya, 4672562, Israel","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"","EBITDA":"-11069000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"-0.048","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-0.935","RevenuePerShareTTM":"","ProfitMargin":"0","OperatingMarginTTM":"0","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-2.47301","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-21.749762","RevenueTTM":"","GrossProfitTTM":"","DilutedEPSTTM":"-0.935","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"","AnalystTargetPrice":"","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"","PriceToBookRatio":"","EVToRevenue":"","EVToEBITDA":"","Beta":"1.541","52WeekHigh":"0.1797","52WeekLow":"0.1797","50DayMovingAverage":"","200DayMovingAverage":"","SharesOutstanding":"","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":""},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"NRSNW","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-06-11","4. Output Size":"C